WEBVTT

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:12.350
Lord Keiro has returned!

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:27.570
I have returned.

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:29.370
Welcome back.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:34.370
It looks like your manliness
has gained quite a bit of polish, Keiro.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:39.780
They were quite tough,
despite being bandits.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:41.080
Don't play innocent!

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.790
Why have I heard reports of you
attacking Lian Tong Temple?!

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:48.360
I had no choice; the bandits
in Tai Shan had fled into the temple.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.190
What?

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:54.530
Subduing rebels was the duty
given to me by His Majesty.

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:58.930
I...

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:02.130
I shall take my leave now.

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:09.550
Why don't you pay Lady Taki a visit?

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:13.950
You've not seen your daughter
in some time, after all.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:25.960
Do you think Tokaku suspects?

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:27.430
Never mind him.

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:30.630
The plan will need to be
revised a little, however.

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:34.670
Yes. We will need to reformulate
the plan from square one,

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:38.470
given that you can't unsheathe
the Xian Jia Lan Wu--

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:39.980
My apologies.

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:41.980
No matter.

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:46.850
Even without the Xian Jia Lan Wu, I will not
be shaken from my path to domination.

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:19.320
Oh! Incredible!

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:21.490
Don't gawk at everything. It's disgraceful.

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:25.020
This <i>is</i> the biggest city in Jing Province.

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:27.830
Wow! You know a lot, Hosei!

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:32.500
Well, I <i>have</i> spent a long time on
the road because of my master's orders.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.670
I've accomplished my objective now, though,

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:39.470
so I guess I'll have to report back...

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:43.080
Oh, man. I don't wanna go back there...

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:46.680
What's your master like?

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.710
A dumb ol' hag.

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:53.020
She's a horrible old lady
with a terrible, twisted personality!

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:56.390
She's a monster! She works
tender boys like a slave driver

00:02:56.390 --> 00:03:01.060
morning, noon, and night
while simply saying, "It's training!"

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:03.030
She sounds intense...

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:07.330
Yeah! I'm just a poor little boy!

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:11.040
Let me cry my eyes out
pressed against your chest, Laila!

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.670
I'm hungry!

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:15.230
--Oh, Laila!
--What are you doing?

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:19.680
Why are <i>you</i> standing there?!

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:22.580
Oh, I wound up hugging a guy...

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:26.050
What are you people doing?

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:28.950
Oh, right! Laila! Gimme money!

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:30.890
Oh, all right.

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:35.060
Here. But don't waste it.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:36.560
Yeah, I know!

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:39.200
Sheesh. He acts like a child.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.890
Run!

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:45.100
Hey, you brats!

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.300
Ugh! Those kids do it every time!

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:51.240
Ma'am!

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:53.750
I'll take all the sweet buns you have!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.620
Sorry, there's only one left.

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:58.610
Huh?!

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:02.710
Oh, well. Gimme one, then!

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.490
Here you are!

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:09.480
--Down the hatch--!
--Hey! Coming through!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.780
Looks like business is pretty good!

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.610
Y-yes...

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:30.480
Anyway, we're having a bit
of a money problem, you see...

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:31.920
You said the same thing yesterday...

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:35.790
Huh? You want your shop ruined again?

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:38.260
This is all I've made so far today...

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.760
This is it?

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:46.470
I wouldn't hold out on us if I were you!

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.700
You don't want your shop ruined, do you?

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:50.440
I'm telling the truth!

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.640
Well, whatever.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.130
Let's go.

00:04:59.140 --> 00:05:01.180
There you are, Mo Brothers!

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:03.320
Who the hell are you?!

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:07.490
We're going to claim the 100
silver piece bounty on your heads!

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.220
100 silver pieces?

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:13.460
I'm pretty sure we don't have
a bounty in these parts yet!

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:17.400
The man you killed three days ago
was a provincial official!

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:21.230
Three days ago, you say?
Do you remember, Mo Han?

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:24.340
We've killed so many that I can't recall!

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.400
Laugh while you can!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:31.640
Killing officials only increases
the bounty on your heads!

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:38.480
Oh? Think you can win
five against three, do you?

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.990
There's more to it than just sheer numbers!

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:42.890
Charge!

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:47.380
Oh, scary! Keep your
filthy faces away from me!

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:53.690
That leaves just three of you.

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:57.370
Damn you!

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:02.230
--Did you see that?
--Yeah. These guys are skilled.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.410
Let's go!

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.690
This is terrible! How could they do this?

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:20.130
They didn't need to kill them...

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:24.060
You're too soft. This isn't a rare sight.

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:27.400
But we can't let those people
push everyone around.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:31.140
Don't be stupid. We can't take on
everyone like them we come across.

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:35.770
We're not on a journey to make
the world right. Right, Taito?

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:40.310
What are you doing, anyway?

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:42.610
My sweet bun...

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:43.780
Ma'am! Give me another!

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:46.770
I told you, that was the last one.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:51.420
Thief!

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:54.480
Bastard! Get back here! Hey, you!

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.800
Damn kid! Get down here!

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:06.760
Why, you...

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:14.010
Fine! You're going to be sorry
for mocking the great Taito!

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:36.830
You're not getting away now!

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:41.010
Now, then! What sort of
punishment shall I give you?

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:44.010
I wouldn't if I were you.
You'll get hurt.

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:48.780
Yeah, whatever. That's <i>my</i> line!

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:51.650
Wh-what is this?!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:53.020
Told you so.

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:55.120
You!

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:57.360
Well, bye! Thanks for the gift!

00:07:57.360 --> 00:08:01.720
Hey! Give that back, you! Give it back!

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.570
--Stop laughing!
--But it's just so...!

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:18.080
Oh, man! I'm gonna die
from laughing too much!

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:19.240
You guys...!

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:21.210
How unfortunate for you...

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.720
Hey, now! Ryuko!

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:28.240
Damn it!

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:32.660
Does he know where he's going?!

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:35.690
I'm guessing he does,
out of wild intuition or something...

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:38.700
I'm coming for you, damn brat!
I'm coming for you, damn brat!

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:40.430
He repeated himself again...

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:51.610
No doubt about it. It smells
like sweet buns up ahead.

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:52.910
What do you mean?

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:55.550
That brat smelled like sweet buns.

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:57.580
What are you, a dog?

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.080
An abandoned temple...

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:00.790
I know you're there!

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:04.220
Just give yourself up
and come out, you damn thief!

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:10.760
Well, if it isn't that stupid guy from before!

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:14.130
I found you! You'll pay
for what you did earlier!

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:17.600
You never learn, do you? Do you
wanna wind up in another world of hurt?

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:20.410
<i>You're</i> the one who's gonna hurt!

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.100
Stop! Up ahead is--!

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.740
Taito!

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:29.550
Think he kicked the bucket?

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:32.380
Told you you'd get hurt!

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.590
Who said I'm hurt?

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:38.080
No way...!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:40.810
Is that all you got?

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:49.600
Don't bully Lien!

00:09:55.810 --> 00:09:57.800
Who are you?

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:03.820
That looks good!

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:08.120
Wait, wait! Don't rush,
there's enough for everyone!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.860
Get in line, guys.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:12.650
Okay!

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:20.700
My money, my sweet buns...

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:22.030
Just forget about it.

00:10:22.030 --> 00:10:25.800
There's nothing that can be done;
he says it's all been used.

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:27.800
I can't believe this...

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:34.780
Here! I'm Shulan! What's your name?

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:35.950
Taito.

00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:38.980
Have some too, Taito!

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.850
Thanks.

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:44.720
We humbly accept this!

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:52.820
Mom...

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:59.970
Thanks to you guys, I was able
to feed them until they were full.

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:03.310
Oh, uhh, no problem.

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:05.340
Do you children live by yourselves?

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:06.880
We're all orphans.

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:07.980
Orphans...

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:10.220
What about the government officials?

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:15.320
Their job is tying us up and beating us.
They won't help us.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.820
That's because you steal.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.920
Are we supposed to just starve to death?!

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:22.830
Stop. You'll wake up Shulan.

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:29.060
Anyway, I thank you.
But just forget about us.

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:34.540
These kids have always lived
on their own, haven't they?

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.610
I sympathize with their situation.

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:40.210
But that doesn't mean
it's all right for them to steal.

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:43.950
Only someone who's never
starved could say that.

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:44.880
What?

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:49.020
I bet you've had a pretty
nice and spoiled life...

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:52.060
You're saying I should overlook
him because he's an orphan?

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:58.260
I didn't say that. I'm just saying
we're in no place to say anything.

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:02.100
Especially not certain naïve people
with a self-centered sense of justice!

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:03.530
Hosei!

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:10.780
Come on. Knock it off, you two...

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:13.610
I'm not sure this is about
someone being at fault...

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:40.640
Whoa!

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:43.170
--Did you see that?!
--Wow!

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:47.810
With proper energy control,
even iron can be cut through like paper.

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:49.080
I see...

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:51.920
Energy Manipulation is a secret
technique of the Eight Great Styles.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:55.320
I hear General Keiro of the Xian
Empire is an accomplished user of it,

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:57.190
despite being self-taught.

00:12:57.190 --> 00:13:02.290
If you can't at least do this much,
you won't even stand a chance.

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:07.290
I <i>am</i> trying to do it how you taught me...

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:11.030
...but I just can't figure out
how to transfer energy into a weapon...

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:15.710
Oh. Still no good...

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:16.840
Again?

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:20.480
Just what kind of energy control
are you doing to pull off that trick?

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.980
That was amazing, Taito!

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:25.120
Do it again!

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:28.220
Hold on, now! Don't push!
Hey! Quit pulling my hair!

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:30.310
What is he doing?

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:34.730
Taito!

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:36.030
There you are!

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:38.230
Did you forget you were
supposed to gather water?!

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:39.560
O-oops!

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:41.400
Get going!

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.970
Found you, you damn brat!

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:52.970
This is him, Big Bro!
This is the brat who stole my wallet!

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:57.020
Oh, he's an adorable boy!

00:13:57.020 --> 00:14:00.350
You've made fools out of us Mo Brothers.

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:03.090
I hope you're ready for what you deserve.

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:05.420
You guys can't get me!

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.190
No way...

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:19.170
Childish tricks like this don't work on us!

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:29.250
Nuh-uh! Let's play a little more!

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:34.450
You made me mad, kid.
Now you're gonna pay the price.

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:37.050
Let go! Let go, dammit!

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:39.260
Lien!

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:40.930
Shulan! Run!

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:43.360
Stop bullying Lien!

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:46.760
Who's this kid?

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:52.040
Yuck. I got my clothes dirty.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:54.370
How dare you guys...!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:59.880
You wouldn't be in this mess now
if you hadn't screwed with us!

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:01.710
Dammit!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.080
Who did that?!

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:05.820
What do you think you're doing?!

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:08.390
Huh? You his friend too?

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:09.890
Take your foot off him!

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:12.060
Huh? What did you say?

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:14.230
Take it off him, damn it!

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:18.160
Don't get the wrong idea, kid.
This brat's a thief.

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:21.330
Shut up! So are you!

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:24.320
I hate it when people bully weaker people!

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:28.910
--He's...
--...no ordinary boy, it seems.

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:31.430
Let's do the usual routine.

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:45.120
I'll start with you!

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:49.490
What's the matter, kid?

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:51.960
Now it's <i>my</i> turn!

00:15:58.040 --> 00:15:59.260
Crap!

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:02.870
Ryuko!

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:08.610
Hey! Let me join the party too!

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:10.350
There's another one?!

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:13.720
Dunno what's going on,
but I'll back you up!

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:14.950
Taito!

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:18.390
Yeah! Thanks!

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.220
So many cutie-pies!

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:22.130
Yikes! Who is <i>that</i>?!

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:25.130
Hey, Ryuko! You can handle that one!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:27.230
Wha--?! I don't want to either!

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:29.730
Oh, come on! I'm sure
you'll make a good match!

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:32.470
Don't be creepy!

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:34.570
You'll pay for saying that!

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:36.900
Don't get cocky, you brats!

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:41.050
Say your prayers!

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:42.880
--That idiot!
--Taito!

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:47.210
Fool!

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.520
Stay sharp! They're tough!

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:53.890
Idiot!

00:16:53.890 --> 00:16:56.990
Do you not have the ability to learn?!

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.930
Don't charge at 'em all by yourself!

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:00.500
B-but...

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:04.500
Listen. Individually, they are
nothing but average martial artists.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:08.740
But when working together,
they become somewhat dangerous foes.

00:17:08.740 --> 00:17:10.340
Then what do we do?

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:13.240
There are three of us as well.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:16.910
Fine. I'll keep 'em busy.

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:18.780
Then I will create an opening.

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:20.080
Then what about me?

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.850
Isn't it obvious? Finish them with one blow!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.120
Leave it to me!

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:28.750
I am Ryuko, an ascetic monk
of the Liu Jia Sect Tong You Temple
and user of the Eight Great Styles!

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:30.390
Here I come!

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:34.590
You won't be so lucky this time, kid!

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:41.610
Not bad, boy.

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:42.710
Whoa...

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:45.040
Big Bro! I got him!

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:47.940
Whoops! I don't think so!

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:54.590
Oh! Mo Han?!

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:55.590
Big Bro?!

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:56.780
Ryuko!

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:00.460
Now, Taito!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:06.260
This is for the pain of the sweet bun...

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:10.100
...and for what you did to Lien!

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:24.440
A-are they monsters?

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:27.810
Lights out!

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:39.260
Hey. Are you really leaving?

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:42.260
Yeah, we have to get to the capital.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:46.600
Then take me with you too!

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:49.470
I wanna be strong like you guys too!

00:18:49.470 --> 00:18:51.460
What about the kids?

00:18:55.680 --> 00:19:00.450
In that case, take them
with you to Lian Tong Temple.

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:03.290
Good idea. If you ask Master Sonnei...

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:07.860
Lian Tong Temple?
I can get strong if I go there?

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:12.160
Well, at the very least you probably
won't have to steal to survive.

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:17.470
Okay. We'll go.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:20.530
Good. In that case, here.

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:24.910
This is the bounty from catching
those guys. Are you sure?

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:27.580
You can't travel if you're flat broke.

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:30.580
We'll write you a letter of
introduction too. Well, Laila will.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.210
Hey, now...

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:38.420
Bye, big sis!

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:40.890
Take care!

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:43.590
Thanks! Let's meet again!

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:45.720
Yeah! Good luck!

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:08.920
The Alkaid boy doesn't understand at all.

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:12.420
He doesn't understand
just how big a star he is...

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:16.860
Now, then. I guess it's time to make my move.

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:25.700
<i>An encounter brings forth</i>
<i>a new power in Taito</i>.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:28.470
<i>This is Hosei's master?</i>

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:32.370
<i>Is this "inner-channel" the other type</i>
<i>of Energy Manipulation we don't know of?!</i>

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.270
<i>I did it! Praise me!</i>

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:36.240
<i>I am Hosei, Koei's best pupil!</i>

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:39.110
<i>I won't let you have</i>
<i>your way on this mountain!</i>

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:43.410
<i>Interesting! Using you sounds like fun!</i>

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:46.780
<i>During a short-lived reprieve,</i>
<i>a deep darkness creeps close!</i>

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:50.650
<i>On Hero Tales,</i>
<i>"Chapter Six: The Red Champion."</i>

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:05.070
<i>I'm going to make my master</i>
<i>acknowledge my skills!</i>
